# Run after /data's persistent properties load and before Zygote starts.
# Both video gates must be off to skip the stock IMS VT client's native init
# and its media.VTS retries. VoLTE and VoWiFi retain their existing settings.
on post-fs-data
    setprop persist.vendor.vilte_support 0
    setprop persist.vendor.viwifi_support 0
